{"id":"df2fcf52189a31bd","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-weak-continuum.md","title":"Weak Continuum Hypothesis","display":"thm-weak-continuum — Weak Continuum Hypothesis","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-weak-continuum","aliases":["58-thm-weak-continuum"],"display":"thm-weak-continuum — Weak Continuum Hypothesis","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-weak-continuum"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-weak-continuum</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-weak-continuum — Weak Continuum Hypothesis"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6289a5647fba3d31\" href=\"?note=6289a5647fba3d31\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md\">../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WCH}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{WCH}_S\\)</span>（本文件刻画的弱连续统假设）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>（连续统基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"99c5552e170feee3\" href=\"?note=99c5552e170feee3\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md\">../batch02/58-df-continuum.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_1\\)</span>（第一不可数基数，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"535817bf563314f5\" href=\"?note=535817bf563314f5\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md\">../batch17/58-df-aleph.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weak\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCH}_S\\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c&lt;2^{\\aleph_1}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weak\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCH}_S\\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c&lt;2^{\\aleph_1}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>弱连续统假设的标准形式是连续统函数在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1\">\\(\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1\\)</span> 之间严格增长。</li>\n<li>上游给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span>，故 Assertion 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}&lt;2^{\\aleph_1}\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}&lt;2^{\\aleph_1}\\)</span> 完全等价。</li>\n<li>“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{\\aleph_0}\">\\(2^{\\aleph_0}\\)</span> 之间没有基数”是 CH，而不是 WCH。</li>\n<li>CH 蕴含 WCH，但 WCH 不蕴含 CH；二者都不能仅由 ZFC 决定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md","status":"resolved","id":"6289a5647fba3d31","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-cardinal-comparison.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-continuum.md","status":"resolved","id":"99c5552e170feee3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}$（连续统基数，见 [[../batch02/58-df-continuum.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-aleph.md","status":"resolved","id":"535817bf563314f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\aleph_1$（第一不可数基数，见 [[../batch17/58-df-aleph.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{WCH}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}weak\\text{-}continuum}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{WCH}_S\\leftrightarrow \\mathfrak c<2^{\\aleph_1}","display":true},{"tex":"\\aleph_0,\\aleph_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak c=2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}<2^{\\aleph_1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"2^{\\aleph_0}","display":false}],"bytes":1135,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4484","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-thm-weak-continuum.md|58-thm-weak-continuum]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["99c5552e170feee3","535817bf563314f5","6289a5647fba3d31"]}